*.js
!jest.config.js
# Hand-written runtime helpers used by the SMA Lambda — kept as plain
# JS (not TypeScript) so the deployed `index.js` Lambda artefact stays
# byte-identical to source for hot-edits in the AWS console while
# debugging. Without this whitelist the broad `*.js` rule above would
# silently swallow them.
!lambda/sma-handler/*.js
*.d.ts
node_modules

# CDK asset staging directory
.cdk.staging
cdk.out
